  <Summary>
    <Abstract>The Heard Island management zones are a polygon and line dataset stored in the Geographical Information System (GIS). These areas were developed inline with the Heard Island and McDonald Islands Marine Reserve Management Plan, published in 2005.</Abstract>
  </Summary>
